WEBVTT

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:37.050
<i>Long ago, an all-powerful 
goddess created this world,</i>

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:43.330
<i>then gave her own life in order 
to create many other lives.</i>

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:50.110
<i>Exhausted, the goddess began her 
eternal slumber in an imperial tomb.</i>

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:55.590
<i>Her death left behind a great power.</i>

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:01.170
<i>The goddess's name was Bango.</i>

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.810
<i>This is the myth of Creation that 
has been told since ancient times.</i>

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.220
<i>H-Hey...</i>

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.830
<i>We'll just sneak in here, star.</i>

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.570
<i>We're just guides, twin.</i>

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:32.590
<i>We'll leave the rest up to you, star.</i>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.980
Leave it to me? What are you...

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:38.160
<i>I'm Shin-chan!</i>

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.420
<i>I'm Wei-chan!</i>

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.230
<i>The two of us combined are Twin Star!</i>

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:44.640
<i>We'll be cheering you on, twin.</i>

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:44.640
<i>We'll be cheering you on, star.</i>

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.600
Wait—

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.470
What kind of guide runs away 
at the very beginning?

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:52.170
You won't get away, brat!

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:57.610
You don't have to yell! 
I can hear you just fine.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:02.620
Oh? Apparently, you're rather tough.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:03.940
Very well.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:08.610
I will now test you to see if you're 
worthy of becoming a tomb guardian.

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:14.750
Ward off any intruders along with me 
and protect this stage from them.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.520
That is... Huh?

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.870
Huh, what? Huh?

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:22.730
Hey, brat! I'm not done talking to you!

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:25.360
Hey! Listen until the end!

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:28.430
Jeez... Like I have time for that.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:33.170
I guess you don't want to 
save this Riku Rei, then...

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:42.110
If you don't pass this test, you won't 
be able to save Riku Rei, Suigin.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.380
How do you know about that?

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.510
Too bad. We missed.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.220
It was a bit too far right.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.520
What? Seriously?

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:05.720
Yeah, seriously.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:10.460
Now, now... We'll hit it next time, Eeyuu.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.230
Roger.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.700
Adjusting the firing angle. 
Loading next round.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.740
Everything's ready, Nee-san. 
Charge will be complete in five minutes.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.010
Five minutes, huh?

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.690
Farin-chan! Create a diversion 
until it finishes charging.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.120
Roger!

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.670
What about you, Phoebe-neesan?

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.530
I'll be doing my usual.

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:54.630
Wh-What was that?

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.380
What is that?

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:00.230
The tomb raiders are attacking.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:02.150
Tomb raiders?

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:08.490
You must defeat them with me. 
That will be your test.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:11.740
Just shut up and let's start this already.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.330
Well said.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.700
You'd better be prepared!

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.810
Let us begin!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:31.010
I am Shostia.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.510
The incarnate of the desert, Shostia.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:47.110
Are you Young Master Suigin?

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.830
Y-Yes?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:53.790
I've... I've been waiting for you!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.580
Young Master Suigin!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:17.770
Huh?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.150
So you remember.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:25.050
We've succeeded in breaking 
the seal on your memories.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.650
Seal?

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:33.550
But, yes... He gave me this scarf... 
 a long time ago...

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:47.000
He was my... Gramps?

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:54.970
It appears you remember now.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.640
Who are you?

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.650
Master!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.910
It's been a while, my grandson.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.250
I'm very happy to see you.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:11.770
What—

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:17.040
Suigin's Chance Encounter With His Grandfather!

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.350
Looks like you're finally awake.

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.110
Who are you?

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.280
Hurry up and get changed.

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.580
It's time for your purification.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.830
Centipede Heart!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.380
Go, my little centipedes!

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:10.110
Take care of those guardians for me!

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.700
You're my Gramps?

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.020
Huh? But, wait...

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.440
Huh?

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:22.840
Suigin. I can understand 
why you'd be confused.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:26.320
At times, I was the genius game designer

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:29.280
and vice president of the 
God Grave Tech Company,

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:32.750
and at times, I was the father 
that raised the beautiful Riku Rei.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:36.340
But my true identity is...

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.400
your grandfather, Riku Yuuki.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.350
One more!

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:04.620
Boo.

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:07.820
Jeez. And it was just getting good.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.900
You guys are Phoebe-neesan's...

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:21.800
All right, here we go!

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:32.180
To be precise,

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:37.430
I am the data that I saved when 
I logged in right before I died.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:42.300
Come, now. Call me Gramps again, Suigin!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.180
This isn't the time for that!

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.780
Young Master, this way.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.750
Looks like they're going at it.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.860
Let's hurry up and take care of this...

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.300
...find the treasure inside...

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:05.540
...and get our hands on it!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.380
What's this?

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:16.970
The cockpit of the guardian, 
specifically made for this hidden level,

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.770
the Guardian Giant Yuuki 34.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:24.370
Wow...

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:30.060
Okay!

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:47.620
Yay, I did it!

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:00.550
Wh-What is that?

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:16.530
Inside the Cross Fortress

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.700
Um... I...

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:16.110
We'll get you all clean!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:16.530
Purification Spring

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.300
Come on!

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.390
Are you having fun?

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:29.460
No more!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin Becomes the Last Tomb Guardian!

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.610
The Silver Guardian!
